    {
      "subId": "7052202",
      "subQuestName": "返回清泉镇，向黛安提出采购订单",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705220201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705220201": {
            "id": "705220201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "欢迎光临「猫尾酒馆」的店铺！两位有什么想买的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220202"
            ]
          },
          "705220202": {
            "id": "705220202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你好啊，黛安小姐，我们给你带来了一笔大生意！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220203"
            ]
          },
          "705220203": {
            "id": "705220203",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "向黛安说明了曲清的采购需求。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220204"
            ]
          },
          "705220204": {
            "id": "705220204",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "哦？璃月北码头新开的那间小店？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220205"
            ]
          },
          "705220205": {
            "id": "705220205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "荆夫港来的水手们提到过那位店长呢，玛格丽特老板好像也从她那里采购过原材料。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220206"
            ]
          },
          "705220206": {
            "id": "705220206",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "最近，曲清小姐在码头向水手们出售解渴的饮品时，也会拜托水手们宣传轻策庄的山泉水。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220207"
            ]
          },
          "705220207": {
            "id": "705220207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "她从轻策庄高价取水，转卖到有需求的地方，只赚取个人劳动的基本费用。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220208"
            ]
          },
          "705220208": {
            "id": "705220208",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "有她在中间搭桥，外地的人能用轻策庄的泉水酿出风味独特的酒，轻策庄的老人们也能获得不少收入，可谓一举两得。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220209"
            ]
          },
          "705220209": {
            "id": "705220209",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "原来还有这种隐情…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220210"
            ]
          },
          "705220210": {
            "id": "705220210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "曲清小姐原来是这样的好人吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220211"
            ]
          },
          "705220211": {
            "id": "705220211",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "嗯，也许以后猫尾酒馆会和她长期合作呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220212"
            ]
          },
          "705220212": {
            "id": "705220212",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "好了，言归正传，你们要买这么多「薄荷莓果」，打算出多少钱？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052206",
      "subQuestName": "与黛安交涉",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705222601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705222601": {
            "id": "705222601",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "好，交易达成了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705222602"
            ]
          },
          "705222602": {
            "id": "705222602",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "至于送货的工作…就交给荆夫港的水手们，直接船运到璃月的北码头去吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705222603"
            ]
          },
          "705222603": {
            "id": "705222603",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "这份单据就交给你们，请把它转交给曲清小姐。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705222604"
            ]
          },
          "705222604": {
            "id": "705222604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那就麻烦你啦，黛安小姐！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705222605"
            ]
          },
          "705222605": {
            "id": "705222605",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#大功告成，我们现在就去向曲清小姐交差吧，{NICKNAME}。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052203",
      "subQuestName": "前往璃月港，答复曲清",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705220301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705220301": {
            "id": "705220301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "曲清小姐，我们回来啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220302"
            ]
          },
          "705220302": {
            "id": "705220302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你需要的饮品已经下单了，明天就会装船，尽快送到码头这边来！请你拿好这份单据！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220303"
            ]
          },
          "705220303": {
            "id": "705220303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "这就谈好了？你们办事的效率未免也太高了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220304"
            ]
          },
          "705220304": {
            "id": "705220304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "我我我，我这就用最好的山泉水泡一壶茶给你们…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220307"
            ]
          },
          "705220307": {
            "id": "705220307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对哦对哦，我们还要去帮其他人订货，就不麻烦你招待我们了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220308"
            ]
          },
          "705220308": {
            "id": "705220308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "祝你生意顺利！下次我们再来你这里享受好喝的饮料！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220309"
            ]
          },
          "705220309": {
            "id": "705220309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "呜…那下次我一定会准备你们喜欢的饮品！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220310"
            ]
          },
          "705220310": {
            "id": "705220310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "一定要常来玩啊！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052204",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705220401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705220401": {
            "id": "705220401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "订单的事就辛苦你们了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220402"
            ]
          },
          "705220402": {
            "id": "705220402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "有了这一批特色饮品，水手们就能换着口味解渴解乏了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220404",
              "705220407",
              "705220410"
            ]
          },
          "705220404": {
            "id": "705220404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "水手们的喜好各不相同，有人喜欢清淡的茶水，有人想要酸酸甜甜的果汁…总是喝同一种饮品，时间长了也会腻。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220405"
            ]
          },
          "705220405": {
            "id": "705220405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "所以我经常向店里补充不同口味的饮品，想尽量满足水手们的需要…"
          },
          "705220407": {
            "id": "705220407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "因为水手们帮过我一个大忙，我最近才在码头这边开店，为水手们提供饮品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705220408"
            ]
          },
          "705220408": {
            "id": "705220408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "不过我还不太熟练，店里的生意不太行啊…"
          },
          "705220410": {
            "id": "705220410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "曲清",
            "text": "再见！祝你们一路顺风！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052221",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705222101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705222101": {
            "id": "705222101",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "唔…你们在开玩笑，对吧？但我们在做生意哦，请别说出太离谱的数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052222",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705222201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705222201": {
            "id": "705222201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "不好意思哦，这样的价格还是太低了，玛格丽特小姐听说后大概会责怪我吧…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052223",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705222301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705222301": {
            "id": "705222301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "我觉得这个价钱很合适！成交成交！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052224",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705222401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705222401": {
            "id": "705222401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "啊呀，虽然这样我们会小亏一笔，但考虑到是提供给曲清小姐的货品，也没问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7052225",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705222501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705222501": {
            "id": "705222501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "黛安",
            "text": "总是用低价试探我的话，我会生气的哦？还是用玛格丽特小姐定下的标准价格成交吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}